{"seq":60,"slug":"speech-recognition-asr","title":"语音识别与 ASR 系统","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 语音识别与 ASR 系统\n\n语音识别（Automatic Speech Recognition, ASR）是将人类语音信号转换为文本的技术，它构成了语音交互系统的感知入口。本 hub 聚焦于语音到文本的识别方向，涵盖从信号处理基础到深度学习模型、从生产部署到前沿探索的完整知识体系。需要明确的是，本 hub 与语音合成（TTS）hub 形成互补分工——TTS 处理文本到语音的生成，而本 hub 专注语音到文本的理解与转录。\n\nASR 技术经历了从基于 GMM-HMM 的统计方法，到深度学习混合系统，再到当前端到端模型主导的演进历程。2026 年的 ASR 领域呈现三个显著趋势：以 Conformer/Zipformer 为代表的高效编码器架构持续优化；自监督预训练模型（wav2vec 2.0、HuBERT、WavLM）大幅降低了标注数据需求；语音与大语言模型的融合催生了原生多模态理解能力，使得 ASR 从独立模块向端到端语音智能体系转变。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先掌握第一章的信号处理与传统模型基础，建立对语音特征和解码流程的直觉；然后深入第二章的端到端模型与自监督学习，理解现代 ASR 的核心架构；第三章聚焦工程实践中的流式识别、多语言适配和领域定制；最后通过第四章了解评测体系与语音-LLM 融合的前沿方向。\n\n前置知识要求：熟悉深度学习基础概念（Transformer 注意力机制、卷积网络、损失函数）；了解基本的数字信号处理概念（采样、频域变换）；具备 Python 编程能力，能阅读 PyTorch 风格的模型代码。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"语音识别基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asr-overview","title":"语音识别系统全景概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/foundations/asr-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"speech-signal-processing","title":"语音信号处理与特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/foundations/speech-signal-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"acoustic-language-models","title":"声学模型与语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/foundations/acoustic-language-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-learning-asr","title":"深度学习 ASR","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/deep-learning-asr","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"end-to-end-models","title":"端到端语音识别模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/deep-learning-asr/end-to-end-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transformer-asr","title":"Transformer ASR 编码器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/deep-learning-asr/transformer-asr"},{"seq":3,"slug":"self-supervised-speech","title":"自监督语音表示学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/deep-learning-asr/self-supervised-speech"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"production","title":"生产部署","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"streaming-asr","title":"流式语音识别系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production/streaming-asr"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multilingual-accent","title":"多语言与口音适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production/multilingual-accent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"asr-customization","title":"ASR 定制化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production/asr-customization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-frontier","title":"评测与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/evaluation-frontier","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asr-metrics-benchmarks","title":"ASR 评测指标与基准数据集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/evaluation-frontier/asr-metrics-benchmarks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"speech-llm-integration","title":"语音与大语言模型集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/evaluation-frontier/speech-llm-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multimodal-speech","title":"多模态语音处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/evaluation-frontier/multimodal-speech"}]}]}